# The directories a rented box checks out (compute's boot.sh: git sparse-checkout set $(grep -v '^#' crane/runtime.sparse)).
# Enough for crane_backends.fastsim ClusterBackend run(seed) on the toy and boat domains, and fastsim.batch.run_batch,
# with no image. One top-level directory per line ([A-Za-z0-9_.-] only, as boot.sh reads it); tests/test_contracts.py runs seeds from a copy of exactly these.
crane_backends
fastsim
theater
plantcard
judge
crane
domains
bench
config
Tools
